#: docs/architecture.md:33
msgid "folio-assistant is an MCP server with a pluggable content adapter layer, a skill system, a typed content-object model, RBAC, and a deploy story. The content it operates on lives in a separate repository — the platform is content-agnostic."
msgstr "folio-assistant 是一个 MCP 服务器，具备可插拔的内容适配器层、技能系统、类型化内容对象模型、RBAC 以及部署方案。它所操作的内容存放在独立的仓库中 —— 平台本身与内容无关。"

#: docs/architecture.md:55
msgid "Separation of concerns — current and future state"
msgstr "关注点分离 —— 现状与未来规划"

#: docs/architecture.md:57
msgid "This repo is today a Tool repo and a Content repo in one checkout. Issue #223 plans the split into five composable folio-assistant instances. Child pages carry it:"
