msgid "The last two look like they disagree — the minimum says a harness produces nothing a human looks at, and the instance page says an instance renders by default. They do not: the requirement is a floor that rises, with  exempt from the visualiser and owing its own / instead, and  the layer where the rest begins to apply. See Where the requirement starts."
